(6089, '37d1ba1f-a91c-4248-aa34-bb083b0b21a0', 'Data Warehouse Project', 521, 'Sangeeth K.M', NULL, NULL, 'ManeKancor', 'other', 9, 6, 6, NULL, 'INR', 20, '2026-01-15', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-11-19', 'Standard Pipeline', 6, NULL, 'Scope for cloud based data warehouse platform and deployment services. Also for GenAI solution once the data warehouse is in place. Detailed discussion and presentation has been proposed with SnowFlake platform and possibility of deploying GenAI with OLGPT to be explored with or without DW platform.                                                                        Update as of 26 June 2025 : Snowflake platform presentation scheduled for 3rd July 2025.  Update as on 19th July 2026 : Awaiting the inputs required to prepare the budgetary quote and to architect snowflake platform from Mane Kancor. The same will be shared by the week starting 21st July. As confirmed by CIO.  Update as of 31st Oct : Budget meeting for the year 2026 is happening from 3rd Nov. The requirement is for data warehouse which will be taken up based on the budget approval.CIO will be meeting us post 10th of Nov to decide the POA.  Update as of 15 Nov 2025 , IT budget for the 2026 has been cut short by the management citing the export market conditions in the US. Have requested client to start with minimum USD 5000 to build the DW. Meeting the client on 18th or 19th Nov to figure the POA to get requirement initiated in the smallest possible manner.', 'medium', 1, NULL, NULL, 'Client has put on hold due to tariff regulation impact on their business in USA. Will be reinitiating the evaluation starting April 2026e', '2025-05-25 14:14:00', '2026-07-18 11:35:00'),
