(6121, '2d3cb17d-8c2f-4e70-916c-4cbc7baad228', 'OLGPT', 1049, 'Rangaraj', NULL, NULL, 'Wheels India pvt ltd', 'other', 9, 7, 7, NULL, 'INR', 20, '2025-05-31', NULL, NULL, 'New Business', NULL, 'Standard Pipeline', 2, NULL, 'Need to Ensure bandwith report is possible in OLgpt\r\nNeed to ensure M365 report like mail,spam,unauthorized report', 'medium', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-05-19 02:18:00', '2025-12-16 11:40:00'),
(6122, '5dbdf62c-94a9-4eef-90af-a7fe3f008485', 'Data Warehouse Project', 1161, 'Jagannadha  Ganti (Jag)', NULL, NULL, 'L V Prasad Eye Institute', 'other', 9, 6, 6, NULL, 'INR', 20, '2025-09-27', NULL, NULL, 'New Business', NULL, 'Standard Pipeline', 6, NULL, 'Have proposed to LVPEI to evaluate setting up a data warehouse. Have to submit few Use Cases which has been done with SnowFlake and Neo4J in health care vertical for them to analyse and take the discussions forward. Targeting to submit the uses cases document by week starting 19th May to Mr.Rathinam.', 'medium', 1, NULL, NULL, 'No updates from LVPEI', '2025-05-17 07:39:00', '2025-12-14 16:22:00'),
(6123, '81480ce7-5aa0-460f-b989-55bc1ac91a9c', 'SFO Tech Data Warehouse project', 530, 'Mohammed Sha', NULL, NULL, 'Nest SFO Technologies', 'other', 8, 6, 6, '2724039.00', 'INR', 20, '2026-08-27', 'W4', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-08', 'Standard Pipeline', 6, NULL, 'Update as of 27th June 2025 :  SFO Technologies will be sharing the use cases that they want to evaluate on SnowFlake after we signing the NDA with them. The POC is expected to be initiated by 2nd week of July. Update as of 19th July 2025 : Discovery session with SFO Tech planned for 21st July along with SFL team. This is to understand SFO\'s use cases and readiness of data in depth for initiating the POC and to submit the budgetary commercial.   Update as of 31st Oct : Competition with Azure Fabric.  Solution with SnowFlake being architected and will be submitted to client by 5th Nov. Testing with Snowflake to be initiated post the solution validation by client. Update as of 15th Nov: Representative data generation for the testing has not been successful. Post the meeting with SFO on 14th Nov it has been decided to use SFO\'s own data for the query performance evaluation on SnowFlake. Demo account along with POA to migrate the data from Azure to SnowFlake for testing will be handed to SFO by 17th Nov.  Testing expected to be completed by 22nd Nov.  \r\n\r\nUpdate as of 22nd April 2026 after the meeting with the CIO and Tech Lead:  CIO has instructed the team to submit a report which will have the the following details:\r\n\r\n1). Migration from Azure Fabric to Snowflake\r\n2).Solution Architecture on Snowflake needs to be showcased to SFO Tech.\r\n3).Details on Snowflake Intelligence and Cortex Code and how the same will value add to SFO Tech environment.\r\n4). List the use cases , scaling requirements and conclude the BOM and final commercial value.  Update as of 5th June 2026 , Meeting scheduled with CIO Mr.Prince Joseph and Mr.Sha by 8th June 2026 to discuss the commercial proposal of SnowFlake and Implementation services and proceed to closure.', 'medium', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-05-17 07:31:00', '2026-09-27 14:34:00'),
(6124, 'eb474db3-692a-4d84-8ac2-d55f9175bb09', 'Managed SOC Services', 531, 'Robinett Jacob', NULL, NULL, 'MGU Innovation Foundation', 'other', 9, 6, 6, '300000.00', 'INR', 20, '2026-06-17', 'W3', 'W4', 'New Business', '2026-06-08', 'Standard Pipeline', 5, NULL, 'We have proposed a collaboration with MGUIF for SOC services. MGUIF being a subsidiary company of MGU, the assumption is that it will be easy to penetrate and scale the SOC services to various Govt. and Co-Op  organisations. The initial proposal has been submitted which has to be finetuned further for which meetings are expected to be called for. The initial proposal has been submitted with Fortinet FortiSIEM platform.  Update as of 31st Oct: IT Director is expecetd to take charge by 1st of November. The discussion will be progressing from 2nd week of Nov. Jayaram will followup', 'medium', 1, NULL, NULL, 'Budget constraints', '2025-05-17 06:57:00', '2026-07-18 09:16:00'),
(6125, 'bf44dcf4-c27d-41b4-9070-8f34bd6561b2', 'Vikas Money Data Warehouse Project', 1223, 'VIPIN ANTONY', NULL, NULL, 'Vikas Money', 'other', 3, 6, 6, '500000.00', 'INR', 20, '2026-09-30', NULL, NULL, 'New Business', '2026-09-30', 'Standard Pipeline', 6, NULL, 'Have proposed to build a data analysis solution based on some use cases which will be identified by Vikas Money. Also suggested to consider applying GenAI for the use cases. We will have to present to them the concept of building a data ware house , have discussion on how the same would be beneficial to them from ROI, TCO and operations and start with some small non-critical use cases for them to gain confidence. Update as on 5th June 2026: Presentation scheduled for 9th June 2026 with uses cases and data in the context of Vikas Money to EA to MD. Post this we will have to present to the MD and Core team for finalisation.', 'medium', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-05-17 06:31:00', '2026-09-27 13:56:00'),
(6126, '0f96f023-258c-40e2-bac6-e8819011f6d9', 'DevSecOps GitLab', 1163, 'Libesh', NULL, NULL, 'Federal Bank Ltd', 'other', 9, 6, 6, '250000.00', 'INR', 20, '2026-05-08', 'W4', NULL, 'New Business', '2026-03-25', 'Standard Pipeline', 5, NULL, 'Proposal submitted for 130 user licenses. Federal Bank is exploring enterprise edition of GitLab to enhance their DevSecOps practices as per RBI guidelines and audit comments. Update as on 19th July 2025: Proposal under evaluation. Awaiting the purchase committee to be convened for price negotiation.  Update as on 15th Nov: Gitlabs has shared the prices to Amvion close the 20 Lakhs but for 100 licenses instead of 130 Nos(Banks expectation). Have to get the assurance from Federal Bank that they will be going ahead with the proposal post which the commercial will have to be approved by the country manager of GitLab for us to submit the formal proposal. Expecting the response from federal Bank by week starting 17th after which the revised proposal will be submitted. Order will come this month', 'medium', 1, NULL, NULL, 'Pending budget approval. Current quote is at Rs.29 Lakhs . Bank is expecting the commercial to be at Rs.20 Lakhs.', '2025-05-17 06:17:00', '2026-07-18 09:16:00'),
(6127, '2a28d23d-e628-43f4-bb8b-42306ec9de35', 'Application Security', 1163, 'Sailas Jose', NULL, NULL, 'Federal Bank Ltd', 'other', 8, 6, 6, '209425.42', 'INR', 20, '2026-02-26', 'W4', NULL, 'Renewal', NULL, 'Standard Pipeline', 5, NULL, 'Proposal submitted for renewal ofFortify SAST subscription with 15 and 20 users. Federal Bank is expected to release the purchase order by end of May.commercial discussion on 14 jan 26, order after conclusion', 'medium', 1, NULL, NULL, 'There is a change in the project team. The new team wants to re initiate the POC based on which further decisions will be mader', '2025-05-17 04:48:00', '2026-03-13 07:25:00'),
