(6608, 'a5431013-93de-4519-915c-397578cb35d3', 'Data Warehouse Project', 1163, 'Anil Kumar A V', NULL, NULL, 'Federal Bank Ltd', 'other', 4, 6, 6, NULL, 'INR', 20, '2026-08-27', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25', 'Standard Pipeline', 6, NULL, 'Federal Bank is evaluating multiple solutions to build a scalable and rugged data warehouse. Bank is evaluating both on-premises and cloud based platforms. We have collaborated with SnowFlake for the requirement. 4 rounds of meetings with various hierarchies at the bank has been completed. Snowflake platform demo has been scheduled for 6th of September. Further to the platform demo, bank will be giving the directions for technical and commercial BOM.  Update as of 31st Oct: The bank is expected to float the RFP by Feb 2026. Closure to be expected by March/April 2026. Update as of 15th Nov 2025: Deep dive technical presentation and discussions on AI/ML , GenAI and Agentic AI has been done by SnowFlake for Federal Bank team on 13th Nov at SnowFlake Bangalore office. The day long session has yielded positive result in building the confidence on SnowFlake platform wrt bank\'s use cases. On the other side, Deloitte has been selected as consulting partner for this project and they are expected to study the banks current environment and submit the report on the way forward by month of February. Once the process is completed, the bank will be floating the RFP which should be expected by March 2026.', 'medium', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2024-09-04 18:43:00', '2026-07-20 10:42:00'),
(6609, '9774e9fa-7209-4082-8322-9314e3bd37d0', 'Application Security- FORTIFY RENEWAL', 1163, 'Sailas Jose', NULL, NULL, 'Federal Bank Ltd', 'other', 8, 6, 6, '255000.00', 'INR', 20, '2025-06-20', 'W3', NULL, 'Renewal', '2025-06-02', 'Standard Pipeline', 5, NULL, 'The prospect is for a platform to scan the opensource source codes. Technical discussion completed. POC to be initiated. Karthik will be sharing the POC pre-requisites by 6th Sep. POC time line will be 15 days.Once the POC is successfully completed, the procurement process will be initiated. Working with Fortify solutions.  (Update as of 3rd May 2025)The file has been submitted for approval to initiate the procurement process.', 'medium', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2024-09-04 18:36:00', '2025-06-21 09:41:00'),
(6610, '0d105fd4-2eac-4a89-ad8c-011b9f309266', 'Digital Risk Protection Services', 865, 'Nataraj KS', NULL, NULL, 'V-Guard', 'other', 9, 6, 6, '1900000.00', 'INR', 20, '2024-09-21', 'W3', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Standard Pipeline', 5, NULL, 'Requirement for Digital Risk protection services (EASM, BM and ACI). Working with Fortinet. Technical and commercial discussions are in progress.', 'medium', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2024-09-04 18:32:00', '2025-05-03 05:27:00'),
(6611, '2fdcd9a4-1ac0-46dd-b6d7-185f648596ff', 'DRPS and SIEM services', 1162, 'Madhu.V.T', NULL, NULL, 'Kerala University', 'other', 9, 6, 6, '2500000.00', 'INR', 20, '2025-12-19', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Standard Pipeline', 5, NULL, 'The requirement for implementation of security solution has been revised from WAF and DRPS to DRPS and SIEM based on the current need at University of Kerala.  Update as of 31st Oct : RFP is yet to be released. IT Director had resigned and there were fund allocation and administrtive delays at Kerala University.', 'medium', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2024-09-04 18:25:00', '2025-12-14 16:28:00'),
