(6613, '3708c8aa-d27b-4af7-b4e8-44b0b1f767d1', 'Cloud migration and managed services', 1162, 'Madhu.V.T', NULL, NULL, 'Kerala University', 'other', 9, 6, 6, '2000000.00', 'INR', 20, '2026-05-14', NULL, NULL, 'New Business', NULL, 'Standard Pipeline', 1, NULL, 'Budget approved by syndicate for migrating on-premises application to cloud. It department is awaiting the orders from syndicate to initiate the procurement process.    Update as of 31st Oct : RFP is yet to be released. IT Director had resigned and there were fund allocation and administrtive delays at Kerala University.', 'medium', 1, NULL, NULL, 'Budget allocation pending from Govt. Governance and leadership issues at University.', '2024-09-04 18:22:00', '2026-07-18 09:30:00'),
